{"seq":2,"slug":"async-await-desugaring","title":"async/await 脱糖：编译器如何将异步语法转换为状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/foundations/async-await-desugaring","wordCount":911,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"async-await-脱糖-编译器如何将异步语法转换为状态机\">async/await 脱糖：编译器如何将异步语法转换为状态机</h1><p><code>async</code>/<code>await</code> 是 Rust 1.39 引入的语法糖，它让异步代码的书写方式接近同步代码，极大地改善了异步编程的体验。但这层语法糖背后是编译器进行的复杂转换——每个 <code>async fn</code> 都被转换为一个实现了 <code>Future</code> trait 的状态机。理解这个转换过程对于调试复杂异步问题、优化内存使用和理解生命周期错误至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>编译器将 <code>async fn</code> 中的每个 <code>.await</code> 点转换为一个状态机状态。函数执行期间所有跨 <code>.await</code> 点存活的局部变量都被编码到状态枚举的对应变体中，形成紧凑的内存表示——无需堆分配。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    AsyncFn[&quot;async fn fetch()&quot;] --&gt;|编译器转换| StateMachine[状态机枚举]&#10;    StateMachine --&gt;|State0| Init[初始状态]&#10;    StateMachine --&gt;|State1| WaitA[等待第一个 await]&#10;    StateMachine --&gt;|State2| WaitB[等待第二个 await]&#10;    StateMachine --&gt;|Done| Complete[完成状态]&#10;    Init --&gt;|poll| WaitA&#10;    WaitA --&gt;|就绪| WaitB&#10;    WaitB --&gt;|就绪| Complete\">graph TD\n    AsyncFn[\"async fn fetch()\"] --&gt;|编译器转换| StateMachine[状态机枚举]\n    StateMachine --&gt;|State0| Init[初始状态]\n    StateMachine --&gt;|State1| WaitA[等待第一个 await]\n    StateMachine --&gt;|State2| WaitB[等待第二个 await]\n    StateMachine --&gt;|Done| Complete[完成状态]\n    Init --&gt;|poll| WaitA\n    WaitA --&gt;|就绪| WaitB\n    WaitB --&gt;|就绪| Complete</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>转换方式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>生命周期约束</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>async fn</code></td>\n<td><code>async fn foo() -&gt; T</code></td>\n<td>输入引用被捕获</td>\n<td>标准异步函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>async</code> 块</td>\n<td><code>async { ... }</code></td>\n<td>按变量使用情况</td>\n<td>内联 Future</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>async move</code> 块</td>\n<td><code>async move { ... }</code></td>\n<td>获取所有权，<code>&#39;static</code></td>\n<td>tokio::spawn</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手写 Future</td>\n<td><code>impl Future</code></td>\n<td>自行控制</td>\n<td>底层库实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"最简单的脱糖示例\">最简单的脱糖示例</h2><p>先从最简单的 <code>async fn</code> 开始：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"async fn hello() -&gt; String {&#10;    String::from(&quot;hello world&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async fn hello() -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    String::from(\"hello world\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器将其转换为大致等价的代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn hello() -&gt; impl Future&lt;Output = String&gt; {&#10;    async move {&#10;        String::from(&quot;hello world&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn hello() -> impl Future&#x3C;Output = String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        String::from(\"hello world\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实际上，编译器生成了一个匿名结构体和 <code>Future</code> 实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"struct HelloFuture;&#10;&#10;impl Future for HelloFuture {&#10;    type Output = String;&#10;&#10;    fn poll(self: Pin&lt;&amp;mut Self&gt;, _cx: &amp;mut Context&lt;&#39;_&gt;) -&gt; Poll&lt;String&gt; {&#10;        // 这个 Future 不包含任何 await 点，直接返回 Ready&#10;        Poll::Ready(String::from(&quot;hello world&quot;))&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn hello() -&gt; HelloFuture {&#10;    HelloFuture&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>struct HelloFuture;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Future for HelloFuture {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Output = String;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn poll(self: Pin&#x3C;&#x26;mut Self>, _cx: &#x26;mut Context&#x3C;'_>) -> Poll&#x3C;String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 这个 Future 不包含任何 await 点，直接返回 Ready</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Poll::Ready(String::from(\"hello world\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn hello() -> HelloFuture {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    HelloFuture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>没有 <code>await</code> 的 <code>async fn</code> 等价于同步函数，只是返回类型被包裹在 <code>Future</code> 中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"包含-await-的状态机\">包含 await 的状态机</h2><p>真正有意思的情况是包含多个 <code>await</code> 点的异步函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"async fn fetch_user_data(id: u64) -&gt; UserData {&#10;    let token = get_auth_token().await;       // await point A&#10;    let user = fetch_user(id, &amp;token).await;  // await point B&#10;    let profile = fetch_profile(&amp;user).await; // await point C&#10;    UserData { user, profile }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async fn fetch_user_data(id: u64) -> UserData {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let token = get_auth_token().await;       // await point A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let user = fetch_user(id, &#x26;token).await;  // await point B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let profile = fetch_profile(&#x26;user).await; // await point C</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    UserData { user, profile }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器将这个函数转换为一个状态机枚举：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"enum FetchUserDataState {&#10;    // 初始状态，即将 poll get_auth_token()&#10;    State0 { id: u64 },&#10;    // 在 await point A 等待，保存 get_auth_token 的 Future 和 id&#10;    State1 { id: u64, auth_future: GetAuthTokenFuture },&#10;    // 在 await point B 等待，保存 fetch_user 的 Future&#10;    // token 已获得，以引用形式传入 fetch_user，所以需要保存 token&#10;    State2 { id: u64, token: AuthToken, user_future: FetchUserFuture },&#10;    // 在 await point C 等待&#10;    State3 { user: User, profile_future: FetchProfileFuture },&#10;    // 已完成&#10;    Done,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>enum FetchUserDataState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 初始状态，即将 poll get_auth_token()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    State0 { id: u64 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 在 await point A 等待，保存 get_auth_token 的 Future 和 id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    State1 { id: u64, auth_future: GetAuthTokenFuture },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 在 await point B 等待，保存 fetch_user 的 Future</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // token 已获得，以引用形式传入 fetch_user，所以需要保存 token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    State2 { id: u64, token: AuthToken, user_future: FetchUserFuture },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 在 await point C 等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    State3 { user: User, profile_future: FetchProfileFuture },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 已完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Done,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对应的 <code>poll</code> 实现驱动状态机前进：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"impl Future for FetchUserDataFuture {&#10;    type Output = UserData;&#10;&#10;    fn poll(mut self: Pin&lt;&amp;mut Self&gt;, cx: &amp;mut Context&lt;&#39;_&gt;) -&gt; Poll&lt;UserData&gt; {&#10;        loop {&#10;            match &amp;mut *self {&#10;                FetchUserDataState::State0 { id } =&gt; {&#10;                    let auth_future = get_auth_token();&#10;                    *self = FetchUserDataState::State1 {&#10;                        id: *id,&#10;                        auth_future&#10;                    };&#10;                    // 继续循环，立即 poll State1&#10;                }&#10;                FetchUserDataState::State1 { id, auth_future } =&gt; {&#10;                    match Pin::new(auth_future).poll(cx) {&#10;                        Poll::Pending =&gt; return Poll::Pending,&#10;                        Poll::Ready(token) =&gt; {&#10;                            let user_future = fetch_user(*id, &amp;token);&#10;                            *self = FetchUserDataState::State2 {&#10;                                id: *id,&#10;                                token,&#10;                                user_future&#10;                            };&#10;                        }&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;                // ... 其他状态类似&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>impl Future for FetchUserDataFuture {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Output = UserData;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn poll(mut self: Pin&#x3C;&#x26;mut Self>, cx: &#x26;mut Context&#x3C;'_>) -> Poll&#x3C;UserData> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            match &#x26;mut *self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                FetchUserDataState::State0 { id } => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    let auth_future = get_auth_token();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    *self = FetchUserDataState::State1 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        id: *id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        auth_future</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    // 继续循环，立即 poll State1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                FetchUserDataState::State1 { id, auth_future } => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    match Pin::new(auth_future).poll(cx) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        Poll::Pending => return Poll::Pending,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        Poll::Ready(token) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            let user_future = fetch_user(*id, &#x26;token);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            *self = FetchUserDataState::State2 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                id: *id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                token,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                user_future</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // ... 其他状态类似</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"状态机转换的流程图\">状态机转换的流程图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Start([开始 poll]) --&gt; S0{当前状态}&#10;    S0 --&gt;|State0| Init[初始化 auth_future]&#10;    Init --&gt; S1[切换到 State1]&#10;    S1 --&gt; PollA{poll auth_future}&#10;    PollA --&gt;|Pending| RetPending1([返回 Pending])&#10;    PollA --&gt;|Ready token| InitUser[初始化 user_future]&#10;    InitUser --&gt; S2[切换到 State2]&#10;    S2 --&gt; PollB{poll user_future}&#10;    PollB --&gt;|Pending| RetPending2([返回 Pending])&#10;    PollB --&gt;|Ready user| InitProfile[初始化 profile_future]&#10;    InitProfile --&gt; S3[切换到 State3]&#10;    S3 --&gt; PollC{poll profile_future}&#10;    PollC --&gt;|Pending| RetPending3([返回 Pending])&#10;    PollC --&gt;|Ready profile| Done[构建 UserData]&#10;    Done --&gt; Ready([返回 Ready])\">graph TD\n    Start([开始 poll]) --&gt; S0{当前状态}\n    S0 --&gt;|State0| Init[初始化 auth_future]\n    Init --&gt; S1[切换到 State1]\n    S1 --&gt; PollA{poll auth_future}\n    PollA --&gt;|Pending| RetPending1([返回 Pending])\n    PollA --&gt;|Ready token| InitUser[初始化 user_future]\n    InitUser --&gt; S2[切换到 State2]\n    S2 --&gt; PollB{poll user_future}\n    PollB --&gt;|Pending| RetPending2([返回 Pending])\n    PollB --&gt;|Ready user| InitProfile[初始化 profile_future]\n    InitProfile --&gt; S3[切换到 State3]\n    S3 --&gt; PollC{poll profile_future}\n    PollC --&gt;|Pending| RetPending3([返回 Pending])\n    PollC --&gt;|Ready profile| Done[构建 UserData]\n    Done --&gt; Ready([返回 Ready])</pre><h2 id=\"生命周期捕获的微妙之处\">生命周期捕获的微妙之处</h2><p><code>async fn</code> 的脱糖在涉及引用参数时有一个重要的生命周期规则——所有输入引用的生命周期都会被捕获到返回的 <code>Future</code> 中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 这个函数签名&#10;async fn process&lt;&#39;a&gt;(data: &amp;&#39;a str) -&gt; String {&#10;    do_something().await;&#10;    data.to_uppercase()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 等价于&#10;fn process&lt;&#39;a&gt;(data: &amp;&#39;a str) -&gt; impl Future&lt;Output = String&gt; + &#39;a {&#10;    async move {&#10;        do_something().await;&#10;        data.to_uppercase()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 这个函数签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn process&#x3C;'a>(data: &#x26;'a str) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    do_something().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.to_uppercase()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 等价于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn process&#x3C;'a>(data: &#x26;'a str) -> impl Future&#x3C;Output = String> + 'a {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        do_something().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data.to_uppercase()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>+ &#39;a</code> 约束意味着返回的 Future 不能比 <code>data</code> 引用活得更长。这在实践中经常导致&quot;返回 Future 的生命周期不够长&quot;的编译错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常见的生命周期问题\">常见的生命周期问题</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 编译错误：Future 逃逸了 data 的生命周期&#10;async fn bad_example() -&gt; String {&#10;    let data = String::from(&quot;hello&quot;);&#10;    process(&amp;data) // 返回的 Future 持有 &amp;data 的引用&#10;    // data 在这里被 drop，但 Future 还持有引用&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译错误：Future 逃逸了 data 的生命周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn bad_example() -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let data = String::from(\"hello\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    process(&#x26;data) // 返回的 Future 持有 &#x26;data 的引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // data 在这里被 drop，但 Future 还持有引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解决方案通常是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>提前 <code>.await</code>：<code>process(&amp;data).await</code></li>\n<li>传递所有权而非引用：<code>async fn process(data: String)</code></li>\n<li>使用 <code>Arc&lt;T&gt;</code> 共享所有权</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"async-块与-async-move\">async 块与 async move</h2><p>除了 <code>async fn</code>，Rust 还支持 <code>async</code> 块语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"let future = async {&#10;    println!(&quot;start&quot;);&#10;    some_async_op().await;&#10;    println!(&quot;done&quot;);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let future = async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"start\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    some_async_op().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"done\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>async move</code> 块会捕获其环境中变量的所有权（类似 <code>move</code> 闭包）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"let name = String::from(&quot;Alice&quot;);&#10;let future = async move {&#10;    // name 的所有权被移入 Future&#10;    greet(&amp;name).await;&#10;};&#10;// name 在这里已经被移走，不可再使用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let name = String::from(\"Alice\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let future = async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // name 的所有权被移入 Future</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    greet(&#x26;name).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// name 在这里已经被移走，不可再使用</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这在 <code>tokio::spawn</code> 等需要 <code>&#39;static</code> bound 的场景中非常常见：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"tokio::spawn(async move {&#10;    // 必须捕获所有用到的变量的所有权&#10;    // 因为 tokio::spawn 要求 Future: &#39;static&#10;    process(data).await;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>tokio::spawn(async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 必须捕获所有用到的变量的所有权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 因为 tokio::spawn 要求 Future: 'static</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    process(data).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"嵌套-await-与状态机嵌套\">嵌套 await 与状态机嵌套</h2><p>当一个 <code>async fn</code> 调用另一个 <code>async fn</code> 时，会产生嵌套的 Future。每一层都是独立的状态机，外层状态机在某个状态中持有内层状态机的实例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"async fn outer() {&#10;    inner().await;  // outer 的某个状态持有 InnerFuture 实例&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn inner() {&#10;    leaf().await;   // inner 的某个状态持有 LeafFuture 实例&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async fn outer() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    inner().await;  // outer 的某个状态持有 InnerFuture 实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn inner() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    leaf().await;   // inner 的某个状态持有 LeafFuture 实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这形成了一个 Future 树。运行时从最外层 Future 开始 poll，一路向下，直到遇到真正等待 IO 的叶子 Future 返回 <code>Pending</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机大小与性能影响\">状态机大小与性能影响</h2><p><code>async fn</code> 生成的状态机大小等于所有跨 <code>await</code> 点存活的局部变量的总大小（取最大状态的大小）。这在某些情况下可能产生意想不到的大 Future：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"async fn potentially_large() {&#10;    let big_buffer = [0u8; 1024 * 1024]; // 1MB 数组&#10;    do_io().await; // big_buffer 跨越了这个 await 点&#10;    process(&amp;big_buffer);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async fn potentially_large() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let big_buffer = [0u8; 1024 * 1024]; // 1MB 数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    do_io().await; // big_buffer 跨越了这个 await 点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    process(&#x26;big_buffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>potentially_large</code> 的 Future 大小至少为 1MB。解决方案是将大数据改为堆分配（<code>Box&lt;[u8]&gt;</code>）或在 <code>await</code> 之前释放不再需要的大型变量。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>参见本章节：<a href=\"future-trait-and-poll\">Future Trait 与 Poll 机制</a> — 了解状态机 poll 调用的底层机制；<a href=\"waker-and-context\">Waker 与 Context</a> — 了解 Context 如何在状态机层次中传递。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p><code>async/await</code> 脱糖将异步函数转换为基于枚举的状态机，每个 <code>await</code> 点对应一个状态转换。编译器自动推导每个状态需要保存的局部变量，生成紧凑的内存表示。理解这一机制有助于：预测 Future 的大小、排查生命周期错误、优化跨 await 点的数据持有、以及理解 <code>async move</code> 和引用捕获的语义差异。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"async/await 脱糖：编译器如何将异步语法转换为状态机","id":"async-await-脱糖-编译器如何将异步语法转换为状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"最简单的脱糖示例","id":"最简单的脱糖示例"},{"level":2,"text":"包含 await 的状态机","id":"包含-await-的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机转换的流程图","id":"状态机转换的流程图"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期捕获的微妙之处","id":"生命周期捕获的微妙之处"},{"level":3,"text":"常见的生命周期问题","id":"常见的生命周期问题"},{"level":2,"text":"async 块与 async move","id":"async-块与-async-move"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌套 await 与状态机嵌套","id":"嵌套-await-与状态机嵌套"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机大小与性能影响","id":"状态机大小与性能影响"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Future Trait 与 Poll 机制：Rust 异步的核心抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/foundations/future-trait-and-poll"},"next":{"title":"Waker 与 Context：高效的异步唤醒机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/foundations/waker-and-context"}}